        "critique_and_reasoning": "Peanuts and raw cashews require 1 to 2 minutes of frying to turn golden, whereas cumin, hing, and curry leaves burn in under thirty seconds. Adding the nuts after the delicate spices have already crisped will cause the aromatics to scorch and turn bitter before the nuts cook through."
