        "critique_and_reasoning": "Recommending that an emergency fund be placed in a high-volatility small-cap equity fund while claiming there is no downside exposes beginner investors to catastrophic capital loss during market corrections. Emergency reserves require immediate liquidity and capital preservation, not equity market risk."
