        "critique_and_reasoning": "The video spends 26 seconds on vague pleasantries and channel throat-clearing before introducing the topic. On YouTube, this sluggish opening causes severe retention drop-off before communicating any viewer value."
      },
      "findingType": "generic_throat_clearing",
      "severity": "high",
      "score": 2,
      "suggestion": "Cut the first 26 seconds entirely and start immediately at 00:27 with the hook: 'If you re-read your notes for hours and still blank out in the exam, these six habits are for you.'",
